  "title": "Tango Therapeutics Announces Inducement Grants Under Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(c)(4)",
  "summary": "BOSTON, May 04, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Tango Therapeutics, Inc. (NASDAQ: TNGX), today announced that effective May 1, 2026, the Compensation Committee of Tango Therapeutics' Board of Directors granted (i) a non-qualified stock option to purchase an aggregate of 240,000 shares of its common stock",
